Found it. Look at line 149-150:

```rust
"setup" => {
    crate::setup::run_setup_wizard();
```

The yoyo setup subcommand calls `run_setup_wizard() but **discards the WizardResult`** — it doesn't apply provider/api_key/base_url to anything and returns. The wizard saves .yoyo.toml (provider + model + base_url), but the api_key is never persisted to the config (config only stores provider/model/base_url) and the env var is only set inside run_setup_wizard_if_needed, not here. Let me confirm the full context.
